  <section class="wrap fiche-body">
    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>Founded in 1983, the Cercle Canin de Grasse (CC06), based on chemin de Roquevignon, has a synthetic-turf agility ground and also offers hoopers (synthetic turf), obedience, tracking and clicker training.</p>

      <h2>What to know before you go</h2>
      <p>The club's official website (cc06.net) presents it as a volunteer-run club founded in 1983 and gives the address chemin de Roquevignon, 06130 Grasse, and the phone number 04 93 36 50 42. In the pages we read, it does not publish class times or prices: contact the club to find out and to ask how to try a session.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: call before coming, as class times and enrolment conditions are not shown online.</div>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>The historic centre of Grasse, the world capital of perfume, is easy to visit from the club.</p>
